Package: wl-clipboard
Version: @DEB_WL_CLIPBOARD_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: X11/Wayland Apps
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/bugaevc/wl-clipboard
Depends: libwayland0
Description: Command-line copy/paste utilities for Wayland
 wl-clipboard provides wl-copy and wl-paste, the Wayland equivalents of
 xclip/xsel. It uses the wlr-data-control protocol to read and write the
 selection without holding keyboard focus, so it shares one clipboard with
 GTK/Qt apps under the iosc compositor. Runs as a native Wayland client.
